OL,3,AAt least 37 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv weapons depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-seven people have died and
OL,7,Falmost 400 evacuated after a Russian
OL,8,Fdrone strike hit a depot storing
OL,9,Fweapons for Ukraine's military near a
OL,10,Fresidential area.
OL,12,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said the
OL,13,Fstrike caused shells, mines and drones
OL,14,Fto detonate late on Friday, triggering
OL,15,Fa blast which damaged nearby properties
OL,16,Fincluding a "care home for elderly
OL,17,Fpeople and people with disabilities".
OL,19,FAn investigation into the "terrible
OL,20,Fnegligence on the part of those who
OL,21,Fstored explosive right next to people"
OL,22,Fhas begun, he said.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
